  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Polynesian Health Corridors Pandemic Preparedness &amp; Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Pandemic Preparedness&#xa0;and Response Workstream of the Polynesian&#xa0;Health Corridors Programme, delivered by Manat&#x16b; Hauora&#xa0; &#xa0;Ministry of Health, works with Polynesian countries&apos; Ministries of Health to support their readiness and response to COVID-19 and future pandemic threats, including through intensive wrap-around support to roll out COVID-19 vaccines. Support is provided in response to partner countries&apos; requests and based on a joint assessment of needs and how best to meet those needs.</narrative>
  </description>
